title: how to define the nodes in this branch
pid: a4894582-7918-42b8-9217-3deb383541d7
body: |2-
  For any node E that was edited, show contentward views
  (that is, a view in which parents contain children)
  from every rootish node R
  (either uncontained or contained by a contains-cyclic root)
  for which E is in R's recursive content.
  Every atom in the spanning forest that is unedited
  *and* whose recursive content is unedited
  is rendered as a write-protected leaf.
